{
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 456
        },
        "text": "World position (for the scan-lines), world normal and view direction (for the rim), and time."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_scan",
        "position": {
          "x": 682,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2684
        },
        "text": "`fract(y × density − t × speed)` is a sawtooth; `smoothstep` of its distance to the middle turns it into thin bright bars that crawl upwards."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_rim",
        "position": {
          "x": 682,
          "y": 737
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "The **Fresnel kit** makes silhouettes glow; the face-on output keeps a faint body so the hologram does not vanish."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_flick",
        "position": {
          "x": 3570,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2292
        },
        "text": "`1 − flicker × (½ + ½ sin(47t)·sin(13t))`: two incommensurate sines give an irregular, electric flicker without noise."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_mix",
        "position": {
          "x": 6066,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1766
        },
        "text": "`brightness = (0.12 + 0.55 × lines + rim) × flicker × intensity`; colour = hologram colour (rim kit already tinted) — additive blending turns brightness into opacity."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f472b6",
        "id": "note_vert",
        "position": {
          "x": 6066,
          "y": 595
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "A tiny sine wave along the normal (Wave Deformation node) makes the silhouette shimmer. Vertex stage only."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 8036,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Additive blend + ZWrite off + two-sided are set in the graph settings."
      }
    ],
